    "detailed_description": "The server will be maintained every day from 0.00 to 3: 00 Beijing time.<br />\r\nPlease don't worry if you can't log in to the game during this period.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe delay in the server may be a bit big. I hope you can understand it.<br />\r\nDevelopers are trying to upgrade the server QAQ.<br />\r\n<br />\r\ncrowning calamity to<br />\r\nMultiplayer Cooperative PVE<br />\r\nUp to 4 players per game<br />\r\nPlayers can stop the attack of the corpse tide by setting traps, collecting resources, and building defensive content.<br />\r\nEvery time a period of time will open the next scene<br />\r\nThe game content of each level is different, but the plot is connected<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 4 free characters in the game, you can choose together<br />\r\nPlay to everyone's strengths<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather resources and build defenses<br />\r\nComplete in-game missions<br />\r\n====================================================<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInfection variation pattern<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe system automatically selects a player to become infected.<br />\r\nInfected people can assimilate mercenaries to win.<br />\r\nWhen the time is over, mercenaries can survive and win.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n====================================================<br />\r\n<br />\r\npvp<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you still trust your friends when everyone is the enemy in a personal battle?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n====================================================",
    "about_the_game": "The server will be maintained every day from 0.00 to 3: 00 Beijing time.<br />\r\nPlease don't worry if you can't log in to the game during this period.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe delay in the server may be a bit big. I hope you can understand it.<br />\r\nDevelopers are trying to upgrade the server QAQ.<br />\r\n<br />\r\ncrowning calamity to<br />\r\nMultiplayer Cooperative PVE<br />\r\nUp to 4 players per game<br />\r\nPlayers can stop the attack of the corpse tide by setting traps, collecting resources, and building defensive content.<br />\r\nEvery time a period of time will open the next scene<br />\r\nThe game content of each level is different, but the plot is connected<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 4 free characters in the game, you can choose together<br />\r\nPlay to everyone's strengths<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather resources and build defenses<br />\r\nComplete in-game missions<br />\r\n====================================================<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInfection variation pattern<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe system automatically selects a player to become infected.<br />\r\nInfected people can assimilate mercenaries to win.<br />\r\nWhen the time is over, mercenaries can survive and win.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n====================================================<br />\r\n<br />\r\npvp<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you still trust your friends when everyone is the enemy in a personal battle?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n====================================================",
    "short_description": "crowning calamityd is an online multiplayer shooter game with cooperative PVE and player-versus-player modes",
